    "body": "`var lbl1 = document.createElement(\"label\"); `\r\n`lbl1.innerHTML = \"<input id=‘test’>”; `\r\n`var lbl2 = document.createElement(\"label\"); `\r\n`lbl2.setAttribute('for', 'test');`\r\n`lbl1.appendChild(lbl2);`\r\n\r\nFor Chrome Canary, Chrome 58.0.3029.110, Safari Technology Preview and Safari 10.1 (12603.1.30.0.34):\r\ninput test labels length is 0\r\nlbl1 control is HTMLInputElement\r\nlbl2 control is null\r\n\r\nEdge didn’t implement labels and control.",
