    "created_at": "2017-05-17T01:55:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-17T01:55:53Z",
    "body": "It seems the current implementation of ```labels``` works only if the control element is connected to ```Document``` or ```ShadowRoot```.  I think this is a bug.\r\n\r\nAlso, ```for``` attribute of LABEL works only if both of the LABEL element and the referenced control element is connected to either ```Document``` or ```ShadowRoot```.  I think it's intentional because ID doesn't work outside of ```Document``` or ```ShadowRoot```.\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
